### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ───────────────────────────────────────────
### Health
### ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Liveness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/startup

### ───────────────────────────────────────────
### Storage — ETag
### ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Get current ETag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/etag

### Set ETag (first time — returns changed: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/etag
Content-Type: application/json

{"etag": "abc-123"}

### Set ETag (same value — returns changed: false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/etag
Content-Type: application/json

{"etag": "abc-123"}

### Set ETag (different value — returns changed: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/etag
Content-Type: application/json

{"etag": "def-456"}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────
### Storage — Diff & Commit
### ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Diff: first submission (no prior data — returns record)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/diff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "area": "Советский район",
      "organization": {
        "resource": "Горячее водоснабжение",
        "organization": "АО КТТК",
        "phones": ["264-18-62"]
      },
      "details": {
        "streets": [
          { "name": "ул. Ленина", "buildings": ["1", "2"] },
          { "name": "пр. Мира", "buildings": ["3"] }
        ],
        "reason": {
          "type": "аварийное",
          "description": "подстанция Радиотехническая фидер 126-01"
        },
        "water_deliveries": [
          {
            "street": "ул. Ленина",
            "buildings": "1",
            "time_start": "10:00",
            "time_end": "18:00"
          }
        ]
      },
      "dates": ["2026-06-10T14:00:00+07:00", "2026-06-10T18:00:00+07:00"]
    }
  ]
}

### Commit the records
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "area": "Советский район",
      "organization": {
        "resource": "Горячее водоснабжение",
        "organization": "АО КТТК",
        "phones": ["264-18-62"]
      },
      "details": {
        "streets": [
          { "name": "ул. Ленина", "buildings": ["1", "2"] },
          { "name": "пр. Мира", "buildings": ["3"] }
        ],
        "reason": {
          "type": "аварийное",
          "description": "подстанция Радиотехническая фидер 126-01"
        }
      },
      "dates": ["2026-06-10T14:00:00+07:00", "2026-06-10T18:00:00+07:00"]
    }
  ]
}

### Diff: same data again (should return empty)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/storage/diff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "records": [
    {
      "area": "Советский район",
      "organization": {
        "resource": "Горячее водоснабжение",
        "organization": "АО КТТК",
